# Data Transform PoC

```elixir
Mix.install([:explorer])
```

## Section

```elixir
%{columns: columns, rows: rows} = %{
  columns: ["date", "price_sum"],
  rows: [
    [~D[2022-06-07], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-08], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-09], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-10], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-11], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-12], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-13], 7_043_819],
    [~D[2022-06-14], 7_532_883],
    [~D[2022-06-15], 7_424_157],
    [~D[2022-06-16], 7_400_892],
    [~D[2022-06-17], 7_519_230],
    [~D[2022-06-18], 7_121_886],
    [~D[2022-06-19], 7_326_898],
    [~D[2022-06-20], 7_284_943],
    [~D[2022-06-21], 6_999_117],
    [~D[2022-06-22], 7_100_803],
    [~D[2022-06-23], 7_175_507],
